{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>On your Shavuot.</b> For the sake of the weeks of harvest-season laws that I preserved for you. The sense of the bet in <i>be-shavu'oteikhem</i> is like <i>ba-nefesh yekhapper</i> (Leviticus 17:11), <i>ve-dam Asah'el</i> (2 Samuel 3:27 — read: <i>be-dam Asah'el</i>), <i>ve-lechem niskaru</i> (1 Samuel 2:5 — read: <i>be-lechem</i>)."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:41:18.242082112Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}